# PartyLeaderWizardHereticAggressive (22163, level 78; the npc line gives the debuff 4088 and the DDs
# 4158, 4622 the template lists), every draw 0: it keeps the DD2 curse aggressive's see hook, so the
# settled character it sees is cursed and struck at once. Its script event broadcasts (10033, 10035)
# are heard by no npc line here and so are not shown: party_leader_heretic_calls shows the call for help
# a hit draws, and tests/ai/wizard_individual6b_test.go keeps the rest.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.WizardBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.PartyLeaderWizard.PartyLeaderWizard
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.PartyLeaderWizard.PartyLeaderWizardDD2
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.PartyLeaderWizard.PartyLeaderWizardDD2CurseAggressive
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WizardBase.PartyLeaderWizard.PartyLeaderWizardHereticAggressive
npc heretic 22163 Monster 600 0 0 level 78 skill SELF_MAGIC_HEAL 4065 9 skill DEBUFF 4088 9 skill W_LONG_RANGE_DD_MAGIC 4158 9 skill W_SHORT_RANGE_DD_MAGIC 4622 9 skill SPECIAL_ATTACK 4641 10

tick x8
approach heretic
  S MagicSkillUse caster=heretic target=player skill=4088-9 hit=2642 reuse=15857 success=0
  desires heretic cast(player,4088,move)=934000 cast(player,4622,move)=934000
